  "query_preview": "/Tuesday through Saturday/...\nAnother stretch of hot and dry conditions will set in next week\nas the Desert SW ridge expands northward. This will bring a\nreturn to above normal temperatures starting Wednesday and\ncontinuing through the weekend. Without smoke this will put \nlower elevations in the mid-upper 90s, however west-northwest \nflow aloft and light winds near the surface would be favorable \nfor smoke to collect from nearby fires. Similar to this last \nweek, the tradeoff for not quite as hot in the extended period \nwill be due to greater smoke coverage/density.",
